<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">TaTToo</span>: Tool-Grounded Thinking PRM
<br class="ltx_break">for Test-Time Scaling in Tabular Reasoning</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Jiaru Zou
